// a positional array of column values ordered to match `schema.columns`; or a base64-encoded Arrow IPC
// stream for `ARROW_STREAM`, carrying native column types rather than stringified values. Inline Arrow
// payloads are size-capped by the service; larger results are delivered through the asynchronous 202
// flow.
